00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:00.140
None of it is hyper dramatic.

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:02.280
No, one's like falling off of a building,

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:03.750
being saved by somebody.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:07.310
These are like serious
medical conversations

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:10.140
that are had every day
within our hospitals

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:13.940
that I think the public
should be more wary of,

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:16.960
because if you, God forbid,
are finding yourself

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:19.130
in that position, you'll be more realistic

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.779
about what to expect from
your doctors and nurses.

